+  done = true;
+  /* E63-E65: scan grid K and lazy shadow compaction 4, both exact (E63 m1x -> m1x.sh4: monster +0.4%, junkshop
+   * +2.0%, classroom +0.8%). Hook: the host fixes E66 measures (DF grid capped at resident blocks, shadow pool 2x);
